      "mergedPostDetails": "VRChat Version: 2022.3.1p2, Build 1249\n\nSorting Options in the Avatar Wings is broken, mainly when sorting by Name. If you look very closely to the video I attach to this post, you will see that it fails to change the sorting options to Name, no matter what I do.\n\nSteps to reproduce: Simply try to swap between multiple Sorting Options in your Avatar Wing, primarily with your \"Uploaded\" ones.\n\nHere's a link to my video. Watch it carefully as you will see that nothing changes whatsoever when attempting to switch between sorting options except for two of the options: https://youtu.be/Ydj2FN2HOzA\nYou may also notice that Post Processing is affecting the Quick Menu. This is because Steady Cam is enabled in the Settings, so that's another interesting thing that I'd like to point out (possibly a Bug too?).\nOutput Log: https://gist.github.com/BluWizard10/d71fe8b92b04825537804d3b18361171 (Note that I was hanging out with friends prior to making the video recording)",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1249] Avatar Wing Sorting Options is Broken",
